                                                "sense_id": "f2ac779f-1c3f-3fa8-905c-77791ea6dbc0",
                                                "text": "The native of some South American tribes use this drug as an aphrodisiac in the form of a snuff called cohoba."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9b917ff-0830-30a7-9cb5-3d758e38e3bb",
