                                                "sense_id": "e9b917ff-0830-30a7-9cb5-3d758e38e3bb",
                                                "text": "Dry snuffs are often adulterated with quicklime, and moist snuffs, as rappee, with ammonia, hellebore, pearl-ash, etc."
