                                                "sense_id": "36cdb09b-96e0-3aff-9a4d-a95000bdc154",
                                                "text": "January 29, 1625, Joseph Hall, Public thanksgiving for the wonderful mitigation of the late morality\nDo the enemies of the church rage and snuff?"
